# Brightspear Zealot: "This creature gets +2/+0 as long as you've cast two or more spells this turn" (CR 611.3a, 601.2i). On turn
# three Bot1 casts the Zealot itself, its first spell of the turn, and it is a 2/4 (the three Moxen cast on turn one do not count);
# the second spell makes it a 4/4 and a third leaves it a 4/4; on Bot2's turn it is a 2/4 again. It has vigilance throughout.

